      "id": "abbreviations-019",
      "text": "It weighs 5 lbs.",
      "group": "abbreviations"
    },
    {
      "id": "abbreviations-020",
      "text": "Mt. Everest is tall.",
      "group": "abbreviations"
    },
    {
      "id": "abbreviations-021",
      "text": "St. Paul is a city.",
      "group": "abbreviations"
    },
    {
      "id": "abbreviations-022",
      "text": "Send it to the IRS.",
      "group": "abbreviations"
    },
    {
      "id": "abbreviations-023",
      "text": "The DVD is in the PC.",
      "group": "abbreviations"
    },
    {
      "id": "abbreviations-024",
      "text": "Ask the M.D. about it.",
      "group": "abbreviations"
    },
    {
      "id": "abbreviations-025",
      "text": "See fig. 3 on p. 12.",
      "group": "abbreviations"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-001",
      "text": "I can't go.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-002",
      "text": "Don't do that.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-003",
      "text": "It's raining.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-004",
      "text": "We're late.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-005",
      "text": "They're here.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-006",
      "text": "You're right.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-007",
      "text": "He's gone.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-008",
      "text": "She's reading.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-009",
      "text": "I'll call you.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-010",
      "text": "We'll see.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-011",
      "text": "I'd like some tea.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-012",
      "text": "You'd better hurry.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-013",
      "text": "That's fine.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-014",
      "text": "There's a problem.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-015",
      "text": "What's the matter?",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-016",
      "text": "Who's there?",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-017",
      "text": "Isn't it lovely?",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-018",
      "text": "Wasn't that fun?",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-019",
      "text": "I've seen it.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-020",
      "text": "They've left.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-021",
      "text": "Let's go.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-022",
      "text": "Won't you stay?",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-023",
      "text": "It wouldn't start.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-024",
      "text": "John's dog barked.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "contractions-025",
      "text": "The dogs' bowls were empty.",
      "group": "contractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-001",
      "text": "Is the cat on the mat?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-002",
      "text": "Are you coming with us?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-003",
      "text": "Did he have a house?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-004",
      "text": "Can you hear me?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-005",
      "text": "Will it rain tomorrow?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-006",
      "text": "Do you know the way?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-007",
      "text": "Has the mail arrived?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-008",
      "text": "Was it worth the trouble?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-009",
      "text": "Should we wait for them?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-010",
      "text": "Could you pass the salt?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-011",
      "text": "Where are you going?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-012",
      "text": "What time is it?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-013",
      "text": "Who told you that?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-014",
      "text": "Why did she leave?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-015",
      "text": "How does it work?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-016",
      "text": "Which road leads to town?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-017",
      "text": "When does the train arrive?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-018",
      "text": "Whose coat is this?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-019",
      "text": "How many apples are there?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-020",
      "text": "What did you say?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-021",
      "text": "You saw him, didn't you?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-022",
      "text": "It's cold, isn't it?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-023",
      "text": "She can swim, can't she?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-024",
      "text": "You're coming, right?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-025",
      "text": "Is it red or blue?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-026",
      "text": "Tea or coffee?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-027",
      "text": "Ready?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-028",
      "text": "Him?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-029",
      "text": "Are they the ones who called yesterday?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-030",
      "text": "Do you think that he will come?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-031",
      "text": "What is the name of the river that runs through the city?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-032",
      "text": "Is that all?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-033",
      "text": "Why me?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-034",
      "text": "How come?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-035",
      "text": "Now what?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-036",
      "text": "Does anybody here remember the old house on the hill?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-037",
      "text": "May I ask who is calling?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-038",
      "text": "Would you like to dance?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-039",
      "text": "Have you ever been to Rome?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "questions-040",
      "text": "Is this the right way to the station?",
      "group": "questions"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-001",
      "text": "Look at that!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-002",
      "text": "What a day!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-003",
      "text": "How strange!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-004",
      "text": "Watch out for the car!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-005",
      "text": "I can't believe it!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-006",
      "text": "That was amazing!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-007",
      "text": "Stop right there!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-008",
      "text": "Get out of here!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-009",
      "text": "We won!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-010",
      "text": "Happy birthday!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-011",
      "text": "Good grief!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-012",
      "text": "Not again!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-013",
      "text": "Hurry up!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-014",
      "text": "Come back here at once!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "exclamations-015",
      "text": "What a beautiful morning it is!",
      "group": "exclamations"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-001",
      "text": "I bought apples, oranges, and pears.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-002",
      "text": "Red, white, and blue.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-003",
      "text": "We need bread, milk, eggs, and butter.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-004",
      "text": "She speaks English, French, and German.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-005",
      "text": "One, two, three, go.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-006",
      "text": "He was tall, dark, and quiet.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-007",
      "text": "Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-008",
      "text": "The cat, the dog, and the bird slept.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-009",
      "text": "Slowly, carefully, he opened the door.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-010",
      "text": "Yes, please.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-011",
      "text": "No, thank you.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-012",
      "text": "Well, that depends.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-013",
      "text": "However, the plan failed.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-014",
      "text": "In fact, it was true.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-015",
      "text": "After dinner, we played cards.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-016",
      "text": "My brother, who lives in Boston, called.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-017",
      "text": "The house, which was old, fell down.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-018",
      "text": "John, come here.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-019",
      "text": "Come here, John.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-020",
      "text": "Paris, France, is lovely in spring.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-021",
      "text": "First, mix the flour; then, add the eggs.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-022",
      "text": "On Monday, we rest; on Tuesday, we work.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-023",
      "text": "He ran, jumped, and swam.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-024",
      "text": "She laughed, and he smiled.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-025",
      "text": "I came, I saw, I conquered.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-026",
      "text": "To err is human, to forgive divine.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-027",
      "text": "Sooner or later, everyone leaves.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-028",
      "text": "Hello, world.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-029",
      "text": "Oh, I see.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "lists-030",
      "text": "Come in, sit down, and tell me everything.",
      "group": "lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-001",
      "text": "There is one rule: be kind.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-002",
      "text": "He had a plan: leave at dawn.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-003",
      "text": "Bring three things: a pen, a pad, and a map.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-004",
      "text": "The answer is simple: no.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-005",
      "text": "Note: the store closes early.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-006",
      "text": "Warning: the floor is wet.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-007",
      "text": "She had one wish: to go home.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-008",
      "text": "Remember this: time is short.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-009",
      "text": "Dear sir: thank you for your letter.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-010",
      "text": "The time is now: act.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-011",
      "text": "It was late; we went home.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-012",
      "text": "The sun set; the stars came out.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-013",
      "text": "I like tea; she likes coffee.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-014",
      "text": "He tried; he failed.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-015",
      "text": "Some came early; others came late.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-016",
      "text": "The road was long; however, we kept going.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-017",
      "text": "She sings; he plays the piano.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-018",
      "text": "Wait here; I will be back.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-019",
      "text": "It rained all day; the river rose.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-020",
      "text": "We won; they lost.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-021",
      "text": "Call me tomorrow; I am busy today.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-022",
      "text": "The door was open; nobody was inside.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-023",
      "text": "First we eat; then we talk.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-024",
      "text": "He is rich; yet he is not happy.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "colons-semicolons-025",
      "text": "Speak softly; the baby is asleep.",
      "group": "colons-semicolons"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-001",
      "text": "\"Hello,\" she said.",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-002",
      "text": "He said, \"Come in.\"",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-003",
      "text": "\"Where are you going?\" he asked.",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-004",
      "text": "\"Stop!\" cried the guard.",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-005",
      "text": "She whispered, \"Not now.\"",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-006",
      "text": "\"I think,\" he said, \"that we are lost.\"",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-007",
      "text": "The sign said \"No entry.\"",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-008",
      "text": "He called it \"a small mistake.\"",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-009",
      "text": "\"Yes,\" said the boy, \"I did it.\"",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-010",
      "text": "\"Wait for me,\" she called.",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-011",
      "text": "They shouted, \"We won!\"",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-012",
      "text": "\"Is anyone there?\" asked the old man.",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-013",
      "text": "\"Good morning,\" said the teacher.",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-014",
      "text": "The word \"cat\" has three letters.",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-015",
      "text": "She answered, \"I don't know.\"",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-016",
      "text": "\"Never again,\" he promised.",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-017",
      "text": "He asked, \"What time is it?\"",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-018",
      "text": "\"Run!\" she screamed.",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-019",
      "text": "\"It is late,\" said Tom; \"let us go.\"",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-020",
      "text": "My mother always said, \"Be careful.\"",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-021",
      "text": "\"Thank you,\" he replied, \"for everything.\"",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-022",
      "text": "The note read: \"Back in five minutes.\"",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-023",
      "text": "\"Well,\" she said, \"what now?\"",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-024",
      "text": "He muttered \"fine\" and left.",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted-025",
      "text": "\"Open the door,\" said the voice.",
      "group": "quoted"
    },
    {
      "id": "long-001",
      "text": "The old man sat by the window and watched the rain fall on the empty street.",
      "group": "long"
    },
    {
      "id": "long-002",
      "text": "When the storm had passed, the children ran outside to play in the puddles.",
      "group": "long"
    },
    {
      "id": "long-003",
      "text": "She opened the letter slowly, read it twice, and then put it away without a word.",
      "group": "long"
    },
    {
      "id": "long-004",
      "text": "Although the road was long and the night was cold, they kept walking until they reached the village.",
      "group": "long"
    },
    {
      "id": "long-005",
      "text": "The scientist explained that the results of the experiment were not what anyone had expected.",
      "group": "long"
    },
    {
      "id": "long-006",
      "text": "Every morning before breakfast, my grandfather would walk down to the river to feed the ducks.",
      "group": "long"
    },
    {
      "id": "long-007",
      "text": "If you had told me yesterday that this would happen, I would not have believed you.",
      "group": "long"
    },
    {
      "id": "long-008",
      "text": "The museum, which had been closed for repairs since last winter, finally opened its doors again.",
      "group": "long"
    },
    {
      "id": "long-009",
      "text": "Nobody knew why the lights had gone out, but everyone agreed that it was time to leave.",
      "group": "long"
    },
    {
      "id": "long-010",
      "text": "After a long discussion, the committee decided to postpone the vote until the following week.",
      "group": "long"
    },
    {
      "id": "words-in-carrier-001",
      "text": "Say the word again.",
      "group": "words-in-carrier"
    },
    {
      "id": "words-in-carrier-002",
      "text": "Say cat again.",
      "group": "words-in-carrier"
    },
    {
      "id": "words-in-carrier-003",
      "text": "Say dog again.",
      "group": "words-in-carrier"
